  "hint": "Each time loop() runs, drive 1 cell and look left. When there's a door, add 1 to doors. Then if (doors == 3), turn in and drive to the X. == checks if two things are equal; a single = changes a variable.",
  "solution": "#include \"Rover.h\"\n\nint doors = 0;\n\nbool leftIsOpen() {\n  turnLeft();\n  bool open = distanceAhead() > 0;\n  turnRight();\n  return open;\n}\n\nvoid setup() {\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  forward(1);\n  if (leftIsOpen()) {\n    doors++;\n    if (doors == 3) {\n      turnLeft();\n      forward(2);\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
